# CHANCE, the third SEQ MODE (after Marbles): its pages in place of the steps', a phrase that plays, REC to lock it,
# REC + OCT+ to mutate, REC + SAVE to write it into the steps (the track back on STEPS); its settings kept in the
# graph heads' slots, saved and loaded with the project, and the graph's own back when the mode leaves CHANCE
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect page STEPS
turn SELECT 5
wait 100
expect page TRACK
turn K1 2
wait 100
expect tp 1 MODE 2
expect tp 1 DENS 86
expect page TRACK
expect tp 1 LENGTH 16
turn SELECT -3
wait 100
expect page CHANCE
tap PLAY
wait 3000
shot chance.png
tap REC
wait 100
expect tp 1 LOCK 3
tap REC
wait 100
expect tp 1 LOCK 0
press REC
wait 50
tap OCT+
wait 50
release REC
wait 500
settp 1 DENS 40
settp 1 CENTER -5
rvsave 3
settp 1 DENS 99
rvload 3
wait 100
expect tp 1 MODE 2
expect tp 1 DENS 40
expect tp 1 CENTER -5
wait 1500
press REC
wait 50
tap SAVE
wait 50
release REC
wait 300
expect page STEPS
expect tp 1 MODE 0
expect tp 1 LENGTH 16
expect tp 1 ROLE 0
tap PLAY
